[{"answer":"It's time to sign up for school.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/1.mp3"},{"answer":"This year Natalie is going to Brock University.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/2.mp3"},{"answer":"She has never been to university before.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/3.mp3"},{"answer":"She is a little bit scared.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/4.mp3"},{"answer":"She hopes she meets nice, new friends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Natalie stood in line to get her picture taken.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/6.mp3"},{"answer":"The picture was put on a card.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/7.mp3"},{"answer":"The card was her picture ID (identification).","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/8.mp3"},{"answer":"She would use this card if she needed to buy books from the school bookstore;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/9.mp3"},{"answer":"if she wanted to get a book from the library;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/10.mp3"},{"answer":"or if she wanted to use the pool!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/11.mp3"},{"answer":"After all of the signing up and money was paid,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Natalie went out to lunch with her mother.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/13.mp3"},{"answer":"\"Mom, I'm kind of scared about going to school.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm going to be the youngest kid there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know how to take notes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/16.mp3"},{"answer":"The teachers might be mean....\",","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Natalie rambled on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Her mom just calmed her down and said,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/19.mp3"},{"answer":"\"Take one day at a time, Natalie.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Worry only about today\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/21.mp3"},{"answer":"\"Hmmm. You're right, Mom. Thanks!\"","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Natalie was very scared on the first day of school.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/23.mp3"},{"answer":"She made sure she had all of the books she needed","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/24.mp3"},{"answer":"and lots of pens, pencils and erasers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/25.mp3"},{"answer":"She walked into the front of the building","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/26.mp3"},{"answer":"and went on her way to try and find her classroom.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Natalie got through her classes and met a lot of new people, nice people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Her classes seemed to go by really fast,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/29.mp3"},{"answer":"and the day went by even faster.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/30.mp3"},{"answer":"When Natalie got home she was so excited.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/31.mp3"},{"answer":"She told her mom that classes weren't all that scary;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/32.mp3"},{"answer":"the students and the teachers weren't scary either!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Natalie knew that the school work would be hard,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/34.mp3"},{"answer":"but she felt good about the people she had met that day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/35.mp3"},{"answer":"She knew she'd have a good year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/136-university-2019-04-07-04-24-28/36.mp3"}]
